# Modular / KISS / DRY

Full decision: `docs/adr/0010-modular-kiss-dry.md`. Lenses: ADR-0000.
Layout: `AGENT.md`. Words: `CONTEXT.md`.

- **Modular:** name modules after CONTEXT terms. Keep public imports
  (`backend.application`, `backend.retrieve`, `backend.ontology`).
  Do not add `app/`, `services/`, `use_cases/`, `repositories/`, `domain/`.
  Split only when two reasons to change already share a file. Deletion
  test: no pass-through packages.
- **KISS:** extend an existing module before creating a package. No
  seam/factory/config for one adapter. Surgical diffs. Do not rename
  `CAUSED`, scoped ids, or Decision categories.
- **DRY:** one source — `ontology/lending.json`, `backend/paths.py`,
  `backend/context_graph.py`, policy facts in `backend/application/`,
  retrieve evidence in `backend/retrieve/`. Do not extract a one-use
  helper. Do not share across a seam that must stay independent
  (Application stays Prefect-free).
